Identified Risks for each risk class:

Risk 1:
Description: Potential rear-end collision risk due to vehicle door obstructing traffic
Severity Score: 0.90
Risk Type: RearEndCollisionRisk

Risk 2:
Description: Driver-side door obstructing view of surrounding traffic
Severity Score: 0.75
